<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"><style>body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th{background:#2f6b55;color:#fff;font-weight:bold}td,th{border:1px solid #b7b7b7;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top}.stage td{background:#d9ead3;font-weight:bold}.note td{background:#f3f6fa}.done{background:#d9ead3}.partial{background:#fff2cc}.no{background:#f4cccc}.title{font-size:18pt;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:12px;color:#1f4e3d}</style></head><body><div class="title">RAG Proje Durumu ve Eylem Plan&#305; - G&#252;ncel</div><table><thead><tr><th>1. s&#252;tun</th><th>2. s&#252;tun</th><th>Durum</th><th>Kaynak Notu</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A&#350;AMA 1</td><td>Temel Atma ve Veri Haz&#305;rl&#305;&#287;&#305;</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Veri ak&#305;&#351;&#305;, temizleme, chunk &#252;retimi ve temel proje kimli&#287;i &#231;al&#305;&#351;&#305;r durumda.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 1</td><td>Hedefleri ve Ki&#351;ili&#287;i Belirleme</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Kurumsal kimlik, resmi &#252;slup, kaynakl&#305; cevap verme ve kapsam d&#305;&#351;&#305; sorulara kontroll&#252; yan&#305;t davran&#305;&#351;&#305; i&#351;lendi.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 2</td><td>Veri Toplama ve Yap&#305;land&#305;rma</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>knowledge_base.json 180 kay&#305;t; chunks.json 1298 chunk; ChromaDB 1298 kay&#305;t. Supplemental kaynaklarla ders kayd&#305;, s&#305;nav/not sistemi, yatay ge&#231;i&#351; ve belge i&#351;lemleri g&#252;&#231;lendirildi.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 3</td><td>E&#287;itim/Test Veri Setlerini Olu&#351;turma</td><td>K&#305;smen Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Fine-tune setleri ana hedef de&#287;il; bunun yerine 113 cevapl&#305;k manual regression, 26 expectation check, 9 casual regression ve intent/source audit setleri olu&#351;turuldu.</td></tr><tr><td>A&#350;AMA 2</td><td>&#199;ekirdek Mimarinin Kurulumu</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>RAG mimarisi BM25 + ChromaDB + reranker + haf&#305;za + kaynak filtreleme ile &#231;al&#305;&#351;&#305;yor.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 4</td><td>Hibrit Arama Motoru (ChromaDB + BM25)</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>JSON-DB uyumsuzlu&#287;u giderildi. ChromaDB aktif ve BM25 fallback korunuyor.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 5</td><td>Yeniden S&#305;ralama / Kaynak &#214;nceliklendirme</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Cross-encoder reranker mevcut. Niyet bazl&#305; kaynak &#246;nceliklendirme eklendi; source quality audit 100/100.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 6</td><td>Haf&#305;zal&#305; Cevap &#220;retme Katman&#305;</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Takip sorular&#305;nda b&#246;l&#252;m/konu ba&#287;lam&#305; korunuyor. Staj, yaz okulu, belge i&#351;lemleri ve ders kayd&#305; ak&#305;&#351;lar&#305; regression i&#231;inde test edildi.</td></tr><tr><td>A&#350;AMA 3</td><td>Uzmanla&#351;t&#305;rma ve Optimizasyon</td><td>K&#305;smen Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Model fine-tune yap&#305;lmad&#305;; retrieval, metadata, source title, intent expansion ve kaynak kalitesi optimize edildi.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 7</td><td>Embedding Modelini Fine-tune Etme</td><td>Yap&#305;lmad&#305;</td><td>&#214;zelle&#351;tirilmi&#351; embedding modeli e&#287;itilmedi. &#350;imdilik veri temizli&#287;i ve retrieval optimizasyonu daha y&#252;ksek getiri sa&#287;lad&#305;.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 8</td><td>LLM'i Fine-tune Etme</td><td>Yap&#305;lmad&#305;</td><td>Yerelde Qwen/Ollama kullan&#305;l&#305;yor; LLM fine-tune yap&#305;lmad&#305;. Cevap do&#287;rulu&#287;u RAG, extractor ve kaynak denetimiyle art&#305;r&#305;ld&#305;.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 9</td><td>Modeli Optimize Etme (Quantization / GGUF)</td><td>Yap&#305;lmad&#305;</td><td>4-bit/5-bit s&#305;k&#305;&#351;t&#305;rma uygulanmad&#305;. &#214;ncelik veri ve retrieval kalitesine verildi.</td></tr><tr><td>A&#350;AMA 4</td><td>De&#287;erlendirme ve Yay&#305;na Alma</td><td>K&#305;smen Tamamland&#305;</td><td>API haz&#305;r; otomatik de&#287;erlendirme altyap&#305;s&#305; g&#252;&#231;lendirildi. RAGAS/DeepEval yerine proje i&#231;i regression ve audit raporlar&#305; kullan&#305;l&#305;yor.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 10</td><td>Kapsaml&#305; De&#287;erlendirme</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Manual regression: 113 cevap, 0 flag. Clean answer rate 100%, expectation pass rate 100%, answerable source coverage 100%, source quality 100/100.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 11</td><td>&#304;teratif Prompt / Kaynak G&#246;sterimi</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Dayanak g&#246;sterimi, kaynak ba&#351;l&#305;&#287;&#305; temizli&#287;i, kaynak filtreleme ve niyet bazl&#305; kaynak &#246;nceli&#287;i g&#252;&#231;lendirildi.</td></tr><tr><td>Ad&#305;m 12</td><td>Yay&#305;na Alma (FastAPI Deployment)</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>api.py mevcut; /health, /chat, /reset-memory haz&#305;r. Canl&#305; kullan&#305;m &#246;ncesi regression &#231;al&#305;&#351;t&#305;r&#305;lmas&#305; &#246;nerilir.</td></tr><tr class="note"><td>Not</td><td>Belgede olup projede birebir ayn&#305; g&#246;r&#252;nmeyen &#351;eyler</td><td>G&#252;ncellendi</td><td>ConversationBufferMemory yerine &#246;zel haf&#305;za yap&#305;s&#305; kullan&#305;l&#305;yor. CoT a&#231;&#305;k g&#246;sterilmiyor; kontroll&#252; prompt kurallar&#305; var. RAGAS yerine manual/source/intent/casual audit raporlar&#305; var.</td></tr><tr class="note"><td>Not</td><td>Son G&#252;ncel Metrikler</td><td>Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Manual regression 113/113 temiz; expectation 26/26; intent coverage 16/16; casual regression 9/9; source quality 100/100; ChromaDB 1298 kay&#305;t.</td></tr><tr class="note"><td>Not</td><td>S&#305;radaki &#214;nerilen &#304;&#351;</td><td>K&#305;smen Tamamland&#305;</td><td>Canl&#305; kullan&#305;c&#305; testlerinden gelen yeni hatalar regression setine eklenmeli; her de&#287;i&#351;iklikten sonra manual regression + source quality audit &#231;al&#305;&#351;t&#305;r&#305;lmal&#305;.</td></tr></tbody></table><br><table><tr><th colspan="2">Metrik &#214;zeti</th></tr><tr><td>Manual regression</td><td>113 cevap, 0 flag</td></tr><tr><td>Expectation pass rate</td><td>100% (26/26)</td></tr><tr><td>Answerable source coverage</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>Intent coverage</td><td>16/16</td></tr><tr><td>Casual regression</td><td>9/9</td></tr><tr><td>Source quality audit</td><td>100/100</td></tr></table></body></html>